  "summary": "Unpinned GitHub dependency enables install-time code execution",
  "details": "package.json for @itsmee_aizat.id/baileys2@2.0.2 declares `libsignal` as `github:tenka-san/libsignal-node` with no commit SHA, tag, or integrity hash. On `npm install`, npm clones the current default branch of that personal GitHub repository and runs any lifecycle scripts inside it, so whoever controls that repository at install time controls code execution on the installer's machine. The upstream content is mutable and unpinned, meaning the bytes installed today can differ from those installed tomorrow with no change to this package's manifest.",
